/* SPFx build variant: entry main.spfx.ts. The AAD types (@microsoft/sp-http) are provisioned on
   demand by `npm run spfx:enable` — see scripts/spfx-mode.mjs and spfx-host/README.md.
   `paths` are inherited from tsconfig.json: do NOT redefine them here (a partial copy silently
